### 1. Check Actuator Health & Virtual Threads
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

### 2. Check Prometheus Metrics
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/prometheus

### 3. Test Validation Error (Empty Role Title -> Should return HTTP 400 with clean error JSON)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/ai/generate-question
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleTitle": "",
  "track": "JAVA_SPRING_BOOT",
  "difficulty": "SENIOR",
  "modelProvider": "GEMINI",
  "apiKey": "test-key"
}

